<title>FRANCE: CGE in Havas for minimum 10 years - Messier.</title>
<headline>CGE in Havas for minimum 10 years - Messier.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Generale des Eaux chairman Jean-Marie Messier said on Thursday his group would be a key shareholder in media group Havas for at least 10 years.</p>
<p>&quot;Generale des Eaux wants to be a loyal, long-term shareholder in Havas, for a period of 10 years initially, but it could be longer,&quot; Messier told a news conference after announcing that his group would raise its stake in Havas.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
